# Change Safety

Apply these rules to every change made in the Impilo vNext repository.

## Before changing anything

1. **Inspect the existing implementation first.** Read relevant docs, contracts, APIs, tests,
   services, frontend routes, backend endpoints, and deployment scripts before editing.
2. **Do not duplicate existing functionality.** Reuse and extend what already exists.
3. **Do not delete or replace existing functionality unless explicitly instructed.**

## While changing

4. Keep **frontend and backend functionality aligned**. If backend functionality exists but
   is not visible in the frontend, **surface it in the UI** rather than duplicating backend
   logic in the frontend.
5. Work on feature/fix branches where appropriate; do not commit directly to shared branches
   without reason.

## Security

6. **Never commit secrets**, passwords, tokens, or credentials. Scripts read secrets (e.g.
   `SSH_PASS`) from the environment, never from committed files.
7. **Never expose internal services publicly.** Only the documented preview ingress is public.
8. **Do not use real patient data.** The Dev Preview Sandbox is test-data only.

## After changing

9. **Run the relevant tests** after substantive changes (`scripts/dev/run-tests.sh` or
   `bash scripts/test/run-preview-gates.sh` before preview deploy).
9b. **Do not auto-deploy preview after push.** Run `scripts/pipeline/run-local-quality-gates.sh` on the VM;
   collect CI via `scripts/ci/collect-ci-feedback.sh`; deploy only after user authorization.
9e. **Full boot:** preserve `impilo-preview` slice; use `impilo-full-preview` + `AUTHORIZE FULL BOOT PREVIEW DEPLOY` for full architecture attempts; report blockers in `docs/environment/FULL_BOOT_BLOCKER_TRIAGE.md`. **Runtime image strategy** (not Dockerfile presence) gates full boot — see `docs/environment/RUNTIME_IMAGE_STRATEGY_DOCTRINE.md`. Do not add Dockerfiles blindly for libs, mobile, or bundled UI workspaces.
9d. **Backend–frontend parity:** `scripts/guard/check-backend-frontend-parity.sh`; **mobile parity:** `scripts/guard/check-mobile-parity.sh`; no production mocks/stubs; update matrices when adding user-facing capabilities.
9c. Check `docs/architecture/SERVICE_INVENTORY.md` and `FEATURE_INVENTORY.md` before new services/features.
10. **Build before deployment.**
11. **Deploy to the Dev Preview Sandbox** only after checks pass, then **run smoke tests** and
    **confirm pods are healthy**.
12. **Report**: preview URL, branch, commit SHA, tests run, tests passed, tests failed, and
    any blockers.
13. **Update `docs/environment/OWNER_PREVIEW_TEST_CHECKLIST.md`** whenever user-facing
    workflows change.
